From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noswad <64293615+TheNoswad@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:20:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd: drop the WL_STATIC_IF placeholder interface

WL_STATIC_IF creates Android's placeholder wlan1. When it is bound and
re-created, nl80211 calls on it oops in dhd_net2idx under rtnl. Nothing
outside Android uses it.
---
 bcmdhd/Kbuild | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/bcmdhd/Kbuild b/bcmdhd/Kbuild
index be4c3ceae..06a41dcad 100644
--- a/bcmdhd/Kbuild
+++ b/bcmdhd/Kbuild
@@ -155,7 +155,6 @@ DHDCFLAGS += -DPRIORITIZE_ARP
 DHDCFLAGS += -DWAIT_FOR_DISCONNECT_MAX=20
 
 #static if
-DHDCFLAGS += -DWL_STATIC_IF
 
 # Wapi
 #DHDCFLAGS += -DBCMWAPI_WPI -DBCMWAPI_WAI
